  "intro": {
    "copy": "Grand set out to rethink credit risk using AI. But turning sophisticated technology into a viable business takes more than a clever product. Working with the 20VC-backed startup from its earliest stages, we helped define the proposition, understand its market and build the brand and digital experience around it. From research with construction businesses and merchants to product definition and launch, the work connected real customer needs with commercial ambition. Within 12 months, Grand had secured its first enterprise client.",
    "title": "Grand",
    "subtitle": "An AI startup, from idea to launch."
  },
